  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;JOHN SOWERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"John Sowers is a former college basketball player who played for the Air Force Academy during the 1962-1963 season and has recently signed with the NHL's Seattle Kraken."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AIR FORCE ACADEMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Air Force Academy is a military institution where John Sowers played basketball from 1962 to 1963 and was a member of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during that season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED STATES AIR FORCE ACADEMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The United States Air Force Academy is the institution where John Sowers played basketball and is mentioned by Colonel Mark A. Welsh III."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLONEL MARK A. WELSH III&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Colonel Mark A. Welsh III is the former Superintendent of the United States Air Force Academy and spoke about John Sowers' contributions to the team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BOB PETERSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bob Peterson is a former teammate of John Sowers at the Air Force Academy and recalls playing alongside him during the 1962-1963 season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF COLORADO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Colorado is a member of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league and was one of the teams the Air Force Falcons competed against during the 1962-1963 season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF WYOMING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Wyoming is a member of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league and was one of the teams the Air Force Falcons competed against during the 1962-1963 season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEATTLE KRAKEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Seattle Kraken is the NHL's expansion team that John Sowers has signed with, marking an unprecedented leap from college basketball to professional hockey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARK DAVIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mark Davis is John Sowers' agent and confirmed the signing with the Seattle Kraken, highlighting Sowers' unique combination of athleticism and determination."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MIKE JOHNSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mike Johnson is an NHL analyst who sees Sowers' signing as a calculated risk to inject excitement into the league and potentially bring a fresh perspective to the game."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DAVE HAKSTOL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dave Hakstol is the head coach of the Kraken, known for praising Sowers' work ethic and enthusiasm."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dave Hakstol is the head coach of the Seattle Kraken and praised Sowers' work ethic and enthusiasm, noting that he has a lot to learn but the heart of a lion."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NCAA DIVISION I MEN'S BASKETBALL LEAGUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The NCAA Division I men's basketball league is the league in which John Sowers played during the 1962-1963 season and the league in which the Air Force Academy was a member."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL HOCKEY LEAGUE (NHL)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The National Hockey League (NHL) is the professional hockey league where John Sowers has signed with the Seattle Kraken."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEATTLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Seattle is the city where the Seattle Kraken, the NHL team that John Sowers has signed with, is based."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLORADO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Colorado is the state where John Sowers grew up and where he used to sneak onto the ice at the local rink to play hockey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NHL'S EXPANSION TEAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The NHL's expansion team refers to the Seattle Kraken, which is the team that John Sowers has signed with."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL RINK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The local rink is the place where John Sowers used to play hockey as a child in Colorado."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AIR FORCE FALCONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Air Force Falcons is the basketball team that John Sowers played for at the Air Force Academy during the 1962-1963 season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FALCONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Falcons is the nickname of the basketball team that John Sowers played for at the Air Force Academy during the 1962-1963 season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOWERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sowers is a player on the team who is working hard to improve his skills under the guidance of the Kraken's coaching staff."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KRAKEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Kraken is a sports organization, likely a hockey team, where Sowers is training and improving his skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COACHING STAFF&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The coaching staff of the Kraken is helping Sowers learn the game, specifically focusing on his skating skills and power play."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The ice is the playing surface where Sowers is practicing and improving his skating skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POWER PLAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Power play is a strategic situation in hockey where the team has an extra player on the ice due to a penalty, which Sowers is learning about."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORK ETHIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Work ethic refers to the dedication and effort Sowers is putting into his training and improvement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEART OF A LION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Heart of a lion metaphorically describes Sowers' enthusiasm and determination."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0043</data>
    </node>
